  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;be a root of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi></math> are distinct real numbers such that the matrix&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is singular. Then the value of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
